            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:45:23.957926+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r2-b11",
            "text": "The shocking macro-economics numbers have postponed the recovery to next year.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:45:23.957926+00:00"
          },
          {
