            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:45:23.957939+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r2-b11",
            "text": "As the compressor on the frig turned on caused a voltage spike on the electrical line, which caused a glitch in the \"room commander\" system.",
